From: Khaled <khaledchoucri@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 17:45:15 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 52/54] POC-16c: folder filters and recommended folder styles

- FOLDER, PACK, LIBRARY and the Mart's CHIP SHELF get a filter bar (TYPE / CODE / KIND):
  UP from the first row enters it, LEFT/RIGHT change the value (only values the list has),
  A the next field, DOWN or B back. The list shows 10 rows to make room.
- SELECT on FOLDER opens BUILD THIS FOLDER: BALANCED (the old auto-build), VS NEXT GYM
  (attack types weighed by Gen 3's chart against the next Leader's type), PA HUNTER (two of
  each recipe chip for every PA you can build, in a shared code), ONE CODE (your biggest code
  and * chips). The result goes into the folder being edited, so F1/F2/extra are presets.
- folder.c: the greedy fill is now GreedyFill(); the auto-build gives the same folders.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FbWSqvcg6G5Gpw6ynvR5tJ
